>\n                        <td><a href=https://ascend-ci.obs.cn-north-4.myhuaweicloud.com/ops-transformer/package/7722/pre-commit.txt>>>>>></a></td>\n                    </tr> </table><p>[2026-06-27 16:29:20] &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;CI执行结束 </p>","created_at":"2026-06-27T16:29:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T16:29:20+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177481221,"discussion_id":"ce44472428f1b6afb98ebb567029d270e401edce","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 `MoeInitRoutingQuantV2` 内核中 `floatQueue_` 缓冲区大小计算不正确导致的精度测试失败问题。变更位于 `MoeV2GatherQuant::Init` 方法中，通过在计算缓冲区大小时先按输入元素类型 `T` 的字节大小对齐 `perLoopCols_`，再按 `float` 大小对齐，确保缓冲区有足够空间容纳全部数据，避免因缓冲区不足引发的精度偏差。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **修复 `floatQueue_` 缓冲区大小计算**：在 `moe_v2_gather_quant_simt.h` 的 `Init` 函数中，将 `floatQueue_` 的缓冲区大小计算从 `AlignBytes(perLoopCols_, sizeof(float))` 改为 `AlignBytes(Align(perLoopCols_, sizeof(T)), sizeof(float))`，增加了一层以 `sizeof(T)` 为粒度的对齐，确保当模板参数 `T` 的字节大小与 `float` 不一致时（如 `half`），缓冲区的行数据量正确对齐到输入类型的完整元素边界。\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-27T16:37:31+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T16:37:31+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177481954,"discussion_id":"d4e78995cb5e5e5fe12a848ff83782fd66b14eb9","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-06-27T16:40:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T16:40:38+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177493233,"discussion_id":"ea2a10e2f6b67adff1fe965ed834057e11dd92f7","body":"/lgtm","created_at":"2026-06-27T17:27:38+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T17:27:38+08:00","user":{"id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","login":"cpy_123456","object_id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","name":"cpy_123456","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cpy_123456"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":177493413,"discussion_id":"d663334384c4c6cd05e023b585fb3d311bce4bac","body":"这是为何，先对T对齐，有对float对齐","created_at":"2026-06-27T17:28:22+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T17:55:13+08:00","user":{"id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","login":"cpy_123456","object_id":"670a36a75010ca4fc3a7bfbe","name":"cpy_123456","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cpy_123456"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68ca5a04d94db731d1dc6287","login":"wuxiyuan","object_id":"68ca5a04d94db731d1dc6287","name":"wuxiyuan","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/wuxiyuan"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":274,"end_new_line":274,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":177506314,"discussion_id":"b03eb4ee915d98187c664ad98db9ab6fe8cb6d7e","body":"/approve","created_at":"2026-06-27T18:30:06+08:00","updated_at":"2026-06-27T18:30:06+08:00","user":{"id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","login":"guoqiuhao","object_id":"68ca59ff08f52b2edaf33c5e","name":"Guoqh","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/guoqiuhao"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"}]